+.about-col .about-logo { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 2px; margin: 0; min-height: 84px; }   /* Viktor: «После лого новая строка»; 1166: both logos one height, their columns level */
+/* HERESY 1166: YuE2's mark (traced from M-A-P's own logo): the word in the page's ink, the circle and the ² in its terracotta,
